NAME
    rumiai-os - activate the branded RumiAI shell environment

SYNOPSIS
    rumiai-os [<shell-argument> ...]

DESCRIPTION
    rumiai-os is a branded root entrypoint. In the current revision it resolves
    to the shared rumiai-os-sh implementation.

    The entrypoint bootstraps through m, prepends the branded ai platform and
    generic command directories to PATH, and starts the managed shell facility.
    Arguments are forwarded to that shell.

    This current shell-oriented entrypoint does not define the eventual RumiAI
    graphical interface architecture.

EXIT STATUS
    On success the entrypoint transfers control to the managed shell.
    Non-zero status indicates bootstrap, activation or shell startup failure.

SEE ALSO
    rumiai-os-sh
